(7778978, 1293704, 91496, '<td valign="top">
Great photo.  So serene and peaceful.  All the layers work together to set the depth of the scene and the riders are perfectly positioned within the frame.  I might tone down the vignette a tad as once I notice it, I am drawn to it.</td>', 'Great photo.  So serene and peaceful.  All the layers work together to set the depth of the scene and the riders are perfectly positioned within the frame.  I might tone down the vignette a tad as once I notice it, I am drawn to it.', '2025-04-01 17:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7778979, 1293886, 91496, '<td valign="top">
Very powerful image.  The tight vertical really works well.  The bright lighting is handled very well.  Not sure if you got lucky with the person or if it was planned.  Having them another 3-4 pews closer would have increased their impact.</td>', 'Very powerful image.  The tight vertical really works well.  The bright lighting is handled very well.  Not sure if you got lucky with the person or if it was planned.  Having them another 3-4 pews closer would have increased their impact.', '2025-04-01 17:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7778980, 1293839, 91496, '<td valign="top">
Well done. Super cute. Focus is great across the frame and the diagonals are wonderful.  Perhaps crop more in on the left as you cut the cow in half.  A real nit, but you could have desaturated or burned his boots a bit as it in the only real bright color in the image.</td>', 'Well done. Super cute. Focus is great across the frame and the diagonals are wonderful.  Perhaps crop more in on the left as you cut the cow in half.  A real nit, but you could have desaturated or burned his boots a bit as it in the only real bright color in the image.', '2025-04-01 17:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7778981, 1293873, 91496, '<td valign="top">
Cool found moment.  Very film like.  Interesting portrait of the man doing something... perhaps you could have used your title for some context on the event to help the viewer to connect with the man.  The blown out whites in the sky and flag are an artistic choice, but to me reduces the overall impact.</td>', 'Cool found moment.  Very film like.  Interesting portrait of the man doing something... perhaps you could have used your title for some context on the event to help the viewer to connect with the man.  The blown out whites in the sky and flag are an artistic choice, but to me reduces the overall impact.', '2025-04-01 17:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7778982, 1293391, 91496, '<td valign="top">
Interesting juxtaposition of the glass and the colored background.  I think the bottle is not in sharp focus, which may have been your intent, but I am not sure it works for me.  The white edges/border are kind of distracting.  Maybe this would do better in an avant gaurde themed challenge.</td>', 'Interesting juxtaposition of the glass and the colored background.  I think the bottle is not in sharp focus, which may have been your intent, but I am not sure it works for me.  The white edges/border are kind of distracting.  Maybe this would do better in an avant gaurde themed challenge.', '2025-04-01 17:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7778983, 1293359, 91496, '<td valign="top">
